From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Caboose <caboose@invalid>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/15] Transfer mapped memory in bounded, packed chunks

Flush and invalidate of socket-shadowed memory are split into chunks no larger
than the device link's window and packed into one multi-range packet per
flush. Process memory for shadows and staging is drawn from one bounded
budget (caboose-bounded-memory/ranges.h). Optional bounded diagnostics time
flushes (CABOOSE_PRIVATE_GPU_FLUSH_TIMING=1) and ten synchronous RPCs
(CABOOSE_PRIVATE_GPU_RPC_TIMING=1).
